abstract: >-
  The sharp finite-population Hoeffding constants for centered contrasts
  of bounded exchangeable sequences are combined with all-finite
  hypergeometric fixed-sample extremizers and a piecewise relative-entropy
  concentration bound on canonical interior margins.
